# Add project specific ProGuard rules here.
# The AndroidX/Compose/Room/Hilt/DataStore libraries this app depends on all ship their own
# consumer ProGuard rules inside their AARs, so this file is intentionally close to empty —
# add a rule here only when R8 breaks something specific to this app's own code
# (e.g. a class only referenced via reflection).

# Keep line numbers in stack traces for crash reports from release builds.
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
-renamesourcefileattribute SourceFile
